---
// About Section - Authority and Experience statement
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-surface border-b border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:s504lx">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4sz0">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 text-primary mb-6 rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syz">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:b9tdtm">
        Built for Confidence in Every Connection
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-foreground font-medium leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35fz">
        "Use with confidence. 9.0 SeismicCo has been working in the seismic anchoring field for many years, tailoring our products to what builders, architects, and industry leaders need to make their environments safe."
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35fy">
        By pre-manufacturing critical brackets and packaging standardized kits, we remove the guesswork from job-site seismic compliance and protect life, property, and facility continuity.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-10 border-t border-border text-left" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syy">
        <div class="p-5 bg-background border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syx">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:kdoahc">Pre-Engineered Systems</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35fx">
            Standardized product geometry simplifies structural modeling and reduces design turnaround for engineering firms.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-background border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syw">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:asrqoo">Job-Site Rapid Deployment</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35fw">
            All brackets ship packaged with matched anchors and hardware to minimize installation delays and labor costs.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 bg-background border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:dn4syv">
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:asrqop">Direct Specifier Support</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/About.astro:jf35fv">
            Dedicated engineering team available to review project requirements, submittals, and custom load constraints.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
